msgid "Brutal Theme"
msgstr "Brutal 主题"

msgid ""
"The theme keeps the neo-brutalist frame: ink borders, hard shadows and square "
"corners. These options change the layout, the colour mode and the login panel "
"material."
msgstr "主题保留新野兽派的骨架：墨黑描边、硬阴影、零圆角。下面的选项只改布局、颜色模式和登录面板的材质。"

msgid "Theme settings"
msgstr "主题设置"

msgid "Login page style"
msgstr "登录页布局"

msgid ""
"Classic puts a full-height panel on the left edge; centered floats the card "
"in the middle."
msgstr "经典布局把整高面板贴到左侧；居中布局把卡片浮在页面中间。"

msgid "Classic sidebar"
msgstr "左侧栏（经典）"

msgid "Centered card"
msgstr "居中卡片"

msgid "Theme mode"
msgstr "主题模式"

msgid "Follow the operating system, or pin light/dark for this router."
msgstr "跟随系统，或给这台路由器固定亮色/暗色。"

msgid "Follow system"
msgstr "跟随系统"

msgid "Light mode"
msgstr "亮色"

msgid "Dark mode"
msgstr "暗色"

msgid "Accent colour"
msgstr "强调色"

msgid ""
"Used for the current submenu entry. All four accents come from the design "
"brief."
msgstr "用于当前二级菜单的选中态。四种颜色都来自设计稿。"

msgid "Electric cyan"
msgstr "电光青"

msgid "Hot pink"
msgstr "荧光粉"

msgid "Acid lime"
msgstr "酸柠绿"

msgid "Tangerine"
msgstr "橘橙"

msgid "Frosted glass panel"
msgstr "毛玻璃面板"

msgid ""
"Blur the wallpaper behind the login card or panel. The hard border and shadow "
"stay."
msgstr "模糊登录卡片后面的壁纸；硬描边和硬阴影保持不变。"

msgid "Blur radius (px)"
msgstr "模糊半径（px）"

msgid "0 is sharp, 10 is the default frosted preset, 100 is very soft."
msgstr "0 表示不模糊，10 是默认毛玻璃值，100 最柔。"

msgid "Panel opacity"
msgstr "面板不透明度"

msgid "0 is only blur, 1 hides the wallpaper completely behind the panel."
msgstr "0 只有模糊，1 完全不透出壁纸。"

msgid "Dark mode panel"
msgstr "暗色面板"

msgid "Reuse the light values, or give the dark panel its own blur and opacity."
msgstr "复用亮色的模糊和不透明度，或单独设置暗色面板。"

msgid "Follow light mode"
msgstr "跟随亮色"

msgid "Custom"
msgstr "自定义"

msgid "[Dark mode] Blur radius (px)"
msgstr "[暗色] 模糊半径（px）"

msgid "[Dark mode] Panel opacity"
msgstr "[暗色] 面板不透明度"

msgid "Login page"
msgstr "登录页"

msgid "Wallpaper"
msgstr "壁纸"

msgid "Show the wallpaper behind the login form."
msgstr "在登录表单后面显示壁纸。"

msgid "Wallpaper path or URL"
msgstr "壁纸路径或网址"

msgid ""
"Use \"random\" to rotate through the background directory, a path under "
"/www, or an https:// URL."
msgstr "填 random 从背景目录随机轮换；也可以填 /www 下的路径或 https:// 网址。"

msgid "Login title"
msgstr "登录标题"

msgid "Large wordmark on the login card."
msgstr "登录卡片上的大号标题。"

msgid "Background directory (available space: %1024.2mB)"
msgstr "背景目录（可用空间：%1024.2mB）"

msgid ""
"Upload jpg/png/gif/webp/mp4/webm files to %s. The login page picks one at "
"random when the wallpaper setting is \"random\"."
msgstr "把 jpg/png/gif/webp/mp4/webm 上传到 %s。壁纸设为 random 时，登录页每次随机取一张。"

msgid "Upload background"
msgstr "上传背景"

msgid "Upload…"
msgstr "上传…"

msgid "Failed to upload file: %s."
msgstr "上传文件失败：%s。"

msgid "Filename"
msgstr "文件名"

msgid "Modified date"
msgstr "修改时间"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

msgid "Delete"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Background files"
msgstr "背景文件"

msgid "Failed to delete file: %s."
msgstr "删除文件失败：%s。"

msgid "No files found."
msgstr "没有找到文件。"

msgid "Branding"
msgstr "品牌资源"

msgid ""
"PNG only, 16–1024 px, at most 1 MiB. The favicon must be square; the login "
"logo keeps its aspect ratio."
msgstr "仅支持 PNG，16–1024 像素，最大 1 MiB。网站图标必须是正方形；登录 Logo 保持比例。"

msgid "Current assets"
msgstr "当前资源"

msgid "Favicon"
msgstr "网站图标"

msgid "Login logo"
msgstr "登录页 Logo"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "未设置"

msgid "Failed to save the image."
msgstr "保存图片失败。"

msgid "Upload favicon…"
msgstr "上传网站图标…"

msgid "Upload logo…"
msgstr "上传 Logo…"

msgid "Both"
msgstr "两处共用"

msgid "Use for both…"
msgstr "同时用于两处…"

msgid "Reset favicon"
msgstr "重置网站图标"

msgid "Reset logo"
msgstr "重置 Logo"

msgid "Reset"
msgstr "重置"

msgid "Failed to reset the image."
msgstr "重置图片失败。"

msgid "Upload background…"
msgstr "上传背景…"

msgid "Failed to upload the background."
msgstr "上传背景失败。"

msgid "Theme update"
msgstr "主题更新"

msgid "Not checked yet"
msgstr "尚未检查"

msgid "Checking…"
msgstr "正在检查…"

msgid "Check failed"
msgstr "检查失败"

msgid "Up to date (%s)"
msgstr "已是最新（%s）"

msgid "New version available: %s"
msgstr "有新版本：%s"

msgid "Current version"
msgstr "当前版本"

msgid "Check for updates"
msgstr "检查更新"

msgid "View release page"
msgstr "查看发布页"

msgid "Wallpaper source"
msgstr "壁纸来源"

msgid "Built-in"
msgstr "内置"

msgid "Bing"
msgstr "必应"

msgid "Unsplash"
msgstr "Unsplash"

msgid "Wallhaven"
msgstr "Wallhaven"

msgid "Unsplash API access key"
msgstr "Unsplash API 密钥"

msgid "Required when using Unsplash wallpapers."
msgstr "使用 Unsplash 壁纸时必填。"

msgid ""
"Built-in rotates the files in the background directory. Bing, Unsplash and "
"Wallhaven fetch an online image at login."
msgstr "内置会轮换背景目录里的文件；必应、Unsplash、Wallhaven 在登录时拉取在线图片。"

msgid ""
"A HEX colour. The default #00d9ff is the electric cyan from the design brief; "
"hot pink #ff006e, acid lime #ccff00 and tangerine #ff9500 also work."
msgstr "HEX 颜色。默认 #00d9ff 是设计稿的电光青；荧光粉 #ff006e、酸柠绿 #ccff00、橘橙 #ff9500 也适用。"

msgid "Expecting a valid HEX colour"
msgstr "请输入有效的 HEX 颜色"

msgid "The theme keeps the neo-brutalist frame: ink borders, hard shadows and square corners."
msgstr "主题保留新野兽派的骨架：墨黑描边、硬阴影、零圆角。"

msgid ""
"The theme keeps the neo-brutalist frame: ink borders, hard shadows and square "
"corners. These options change the layout and the colour mode."
msgstr "主题保留新野兽派的骨架：墨黑描边、硬阴影、零圆角。下面的选项只改布局和颜色模式。"

msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "外观"

msgid "Unable to save the theme mode."
msgstr "保存主题模式失败。"
